WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.880
Running Facebook ads is only part of the equation.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.300
Where are you sending people after they click?

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.600
If that page isn't clear, easy to navigate,
and built to guide someone

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.600
towards taking action, more traffic
is not going to solve the problem.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.400
Don't just get the click and be ready
for what comes next.
